      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Calls UpdateResourceStreaming(), and does per-frame cleaning. Call once per frame.\n@param DeltaTime\t\t\t\tTime since last call in seconds\n@param bProcessEverything\t[opt] If true, process all resources with no throttling limits",
