          "type": "Float",
          "default": "0.0f"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Int",
      "docs": "Streams in/out all resources that wants to and blocks until it's done.\n@param TimeLimit\t\t\t\t\tMaximum number of seconds to wait for streaming I/O. If zero, uses .ini setting\n@return\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNumber of streaming requests still in flight, if the time limit was reached before they were finished."
    },
    {
      "id": "add-view-information",
      "name": "AddViewInformation",
      "category": "ContentStreaming",
      "signature": "AddViewInformation(Target, View Origin, Screen Size, FOV Screen Size, Boost Factor, Override Location, Duration, In Actor To Boost, In World)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "IStreamingManager*"
        },
        {
          "name": "View Origin",
          "type": "FVector&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Screen Size",
          "type": "Float"
        },
        {
          "name": "FOV Screen Size",
          "type": "Float"
        },
        {
          "name": "Boost Factor",
          "type": "Float",
          "default": "1.0f"
        },
        {
          "name": "Override Location",
          "type": "Bool",
          "default": "false"
        },
        {
          "name": "Duration",
          "type": "Float",
          "default": "0.0f"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Actor To Boost",
          "type": "TWeakObjectPtr<AActor>",
          "default": "NULL"
        },
        {
          "name": "In World",
          "type": "TWeakObjectPtr<UWorld>",
          "default": "NULL"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Adds the passed in view information to the static array.\n@param ScreenSize\t\t\tScreen size\n@param FOVScreenSize\t\t\tScreen size taking FOV into account\n@param BoostFactor\t\t\tA factor that affects all streaming distances for this location. 1.0f is default. Higher means higher-resolution textures and vice versa.\n@param bOverrideLocation\t\tWhether this is an override location, which forces the streaming system to ignore all other regular locations\n@param Duration\t\t\t\tHow long the streaming system should keep checking this location, in seconds. 0 means just for the next Tick.\n@param InActorToBoost\t\tOptional pointer to an actor who's textures should have their streaming priority boosted\n@param InWorld\t\t\t\tThe world this view is located in"
    },
    {
      "id": "add-view-location",
      "name": "AddViewLocation",
      "category": "ContentStreaming",
      "signature": "AddViewLocation(Target, Location, Boost Factor, Override Location, Duration)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "IStreamingManager*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Location",
          "type": "FVector&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Boost Factor",
          "type": "Float",
          "default": "1.0f"
        },
        {
          "name": "Override Location",
          "type": "Bool",
          "default": "false"
        },
        {
          "name": "Duration",
          "type": "Float",
          "default": "0.0f"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Queue up view locations to the streaming system. These locations will be added properly at the next call to AddViewInformation,\nre-using the screensize and FOV settings.\n@param Location\t\t\t\tWorld-space view origin\n@param BoostFactor\t\t\tA factor that affects all streaming distances for this location. 1.0f is default. Higher means higher-resolution textures and vice versa.\n@param bOverrideLocation\t\tWhether this is an override location, which forces the streaming system to ignore all other locations\n@param Duration\t\t\t\tHow long the streaming system should keep checking this location, in seconds. 0 means just for the next Tick."
    },
